        <mxCell id="hmdaI1omH98QlSzwTdtG-4" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;++&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- When can you get an injunction for private nuisance: substantial and unreasonable*&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="240" x="1490" y="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4homZRzTEXkFasWR4ho3-2" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Pile&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- party whose property is subject to encroachment has an absolute right to an injunction ordering encroachment to be removed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="240" x="1820" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4homZRzTEXkFasWR4ho3-5" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Golden Press&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;An injunction may be denied and plaintiff relegated to monetary damages if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- encroachment is uninterntial and non-negligent&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;encroachment is slight&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Plaintiff’s use is not affected&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Damage to plaintiff is small and fairly compensable, and cost of removal is so great as to cause grave hardship or otherwise make its removal&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;unconscionable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="225" width="260" x="1820" y="385" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ih6656PmO_7-DYJXxeCz-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#3399FF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Private Nuisance:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hendriks v. Stalnaker&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;to be actionable, a private nuisance must create “substantial&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;and unreasonable interference” with the owner’s use and enjoyment&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
