        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FTCWs5QpXGFsPEkWrHLz-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creation:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Creation of something, typically talked about in the sense of information&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&quot;nontrivial good&quot; - main purpose is to provide incentives for production and not assurance that is it allocated efficiently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="162.5" width="190" x="2200" y="307.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LY5qmc9q-rRQfSBt9m9M-2" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;For underground pool of oil&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;As long as drill is in your ad coelum you can drain any pool that touches yours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="190" x="890" y="670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zWpe88JOYE1gftBKEWow-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="yAvsYkmpef7pM0Q-w-Bz-1" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=12;startSize=8;endSize=8;" target="zWpe88JOYE1gftBKEWow-1" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CsC3nvJYdk2hQE20r2mF-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="yAvsYkmpef7pM0Q-w-Bz-1" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=12;startSize=8;endSize=8;" target="CsC3nvJYdk2hQE20r2mF-1" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yAvsYkmpef7pM0Q-w-Bz-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#66B2FF);" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Adverser&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;possession of property&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Taking possession of property just by being there for years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="230" x="710" y="820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zWpe88JOYE1gftBKEWow-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Purpose of adverse possession&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;four big theories:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Sleeping theory: law punishes those who sleep on their rights - negligent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) Earning theory: Law favors the owner who is using the land productively, not letting it go to waste. Utilitarian stand point - reward the worker, penalize the slaker&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) Psychological theory: A person puts down roots in a land, even if stolen after ten years would be a psychological blow. Loss adverstion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;i&gt;*The pain of loosing something&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt; &lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;you have is much greater than loosing something you never really use.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;*&lt;i&gt;Prioritizes the real human connection &lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;to the land&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(4) Cleaning cobwebs theory: adverse possession protects from old stale invisible claims, like mistakes in deeds. Assurance that title is clean.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="340" x="860" y="980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
